    "complete_original_hunks": 10,
    "review": "Individually review the full observer commit: all4 complete originals and10 hunks. The added shouldIgnoreRecord helper skips comment characterData and comment-only childList mutations; observe maps out those records and drops empty batches while preserving unsubscribe/unobserve. Four new real comment/text cases preserve positive text notifications and negative comment assertions. All63 old cases remain,59 complete callbacks are unchanged; four change fake-record inputs only. Live-announcer and tab-header fake payloads are also corrected. The same helper and filter pipeline occur in the published source maps AND shipped JS at CDK22.1.7 and21.2.14. Those minimums deliver through NgZone.run rather than the original direct subscriber, so delivery-context, renderer, focus/state/lifetime and floor equivalence are not claimed. Current owned tabs/form-field/checkbox/slide-toggle delegate through public ObserversModule; their existing fake callbacks already supply noncomment MutationRecord arrays. Preserve historical handlers, text guards, DOM/CSS/SCSS and all owned tests; do not fork the CDK. Keep inherited public-peer runtime/delegation admission open rather than label source presence executed.",
    "source_conclusion_only": true,
    "actual_runtime_or_floor_qualified": false
  },
  "whole_original_frames": {
